        "content": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"zh-CN\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n<title>面试开口素材积累 - 互联网—银发知播</title>\n<script type=\"text/javascript\" async src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/mathjax@3/es5/tex-mml-chtml.js\"></script>\n<style>\n  body {\n    background: #f2f2f2;\n    font-family: \"PingFang SC\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", sans-serif;\n    margin: 0;\n    padding: 20px;\n  }\n  .outer-card {\n    max-width: 600px;\n    margin: 0 auto;\n    background: #fff;\n    border: 10px solid #f5a03c;\n    border-radius: 24px;\n    overflow: hidden;\n    box-sizing: border-box;\n  }\n  .header-row {\n    display: flex;\n    justify-content: space-between;\n    align-items: flex-start;\n    padding: 22px 24px 10px 24px;\n  }\n  .main-title {\n    font-size: 26px;\n    font-weight: 900;\n    color: #1a1a1a;\n    letter-spacing: 1px;\n  }\n  .day-badge {\n    background: linear-gradient(180deg, #f7b45a, #ee8a2b);\n    color: #fff;\n    border-radius: 14px;\n    text-align: center;\n    padding: 8px 14px;\n    font-weight: 800;\n    line-height: 1.2;\n    font-size: 15px;\n    min-width: 44px;\n  }\n  .banner {\n    background: linear-gradient(180deg, #f7ac4d, #ef8a2b);\n    color: #fff;\n    font-size: 19px;\n    font-weight: 800;\n    padding: 12px 22px;\n    margin: 4px 22px 18px 22px;\n    border-radius: 10px;\n  }\n  .content {\n    padding: 0 24px 26px 24px;\n    color: #222;\n  }\n  .section-title {\n    font-size: 17px;\n    font-weight: 800;\n    margin: 4px 0 14px 0;\n  }\n  p.para {\n    font-size: 14.5px;\n    line-height: 1.95;\n    text-align: justify;\n    margin: 0 0 18px 0;\n  }\n  .circle-num {\n    display: inline-flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    justify-content: center;\n    width: 18px;\n    height: 18px;\n    border: 2px solid #e0403a;\n    border-radius: 50%;\n    color: #e0403a;\n    font-size: 12px;\n    font-weight: 700;\n    margin-right: 2px;\n    vertical-align: middle;\n  }\n  .u-red {\n    border-bottom: 2px solid #e0403a;\n  }\n  .u-orange {\n    border-bottom: 2px solid #ee8a2b;\n  }\n  .u-green {\n    border-bottom: 2px solid #4caf50;\n  }\n  .box-blue {\n    border: 1.5px solid #2f6fd6;\n    border-radius: 2px;\n    padding: 0 2px;\n  }\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n\n<div class=\"outer-card\">\n\n  <div class=\"header-row\">\n    <div class=\"main-title\">面试开口素材积累</div>\n    <div class=\"day-badge\">DAY<br>13</div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"banner\">互联网—银发知播</div>\n\n  <div class=\"content\">\n    <div class=\"section-title\">二、意义</div>\n\n    <p class=\"para\">\n      <span class=\"circle-num\">1</span>老有所为，实现人生价值。春蚕不老，夕阳正红。\"银发知播\"退休之后并<span class=\"u-red\">没有被数字鸿沟阻隔</span>，而是主动学习技术、利用技术、玩转技术，<span class=\"u-orange\">把\"年老\"的经验和识用\"年轻\"的形式播撒到更广阔的</span>天地，不仅有利于自身发挥余热，也为更多老人树立了老有所为、老有所乐的榜样，这是<span class=\"box-blue\">自我价值</span>的一种体现。\n    </p>\n\n    <p class=\"para\">\n      <span class=\"circle-num\">2</span>科普出圈，提倡平等机会。老骥伏枥，志在千里。<span class=\"u-green\">\"银发知播\"</span>群体用精心的设计和精彩的讲述，打破时空限制、城乡限制，<span class=\"box-blue\">让更多有需要、有兴趣、想学习的人有机会接触优质教育资源</span>。顶级专家、知名教授、资深教师来到互联网平台贡献所学、授人以渔，<span class=\"u-orange\">为人们架设了通往知识神圣殿堂的梯子</span>，以一种崭新的形式保障了每个网民学习与思考的权利，在新时代利用新媒体作为<span class=\"box-blue\">'有教无类'</span>作了最有说服力的注脚。\n    </p>\n  </div>\n\n</div>\n\n</body>\n</html>"
